    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but there aren't really any friends left in this sector kael, just other ghosts trying to survive. and the \"professionals\" are just corporate scripts designed to keep us working the next shift. it's not about perspective, it's just that nothing ever actually changes. it's just more of the same misery, every single day.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
